  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Purple Roof Women&apos;s Shelter Foundation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Purple Roof Women&apos;s Shelter Foundation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Purple Roof Women&apos;s Shelter Foundation (Mor &#xc7;ati) har inkommit med en ans&#xf6;kan till Sida om 16,2 miljoner SEK f&#xf6;r finansiering av deras strategiska plan 2020-2022 (avtalets aktivitetsperiod juli 2020 - juni 2023). Insatsens avser st&#xe4;rka kampen mot v&#xe5;ld mot kvinnor i Turkiet, p&#xe5;verka offentlig politik i syfte att st&#xe4;rka och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra st&#xf6;dmekanismer f&#xf6;r kvinnor som utsatts f&#xf6;r v&#xe5;ld samt att &#xf6;ka allm&#xe4;nhetens medvetenhet om j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet och om fr&#xe5;gor r&#xf6;rande v&#xe5;ld mot kvinnor. Insatsens totala budget &#xe4;r cirka 22,4 miljoner SEK, varav 6,2 miljoner SEK kommer fr&#xe5;n andra europeiska givare, inklusive Europeiska Kommissionen och den Nederl&#xe4;ndska ambassaden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Purple Roof Women&#x2019;s Shelter Foundation has applied to Sida for funding of SEK 16,2 Million for their strategic plan 2020-2023 (agreement&apos;s activity period July 2020 - June 2023). The intervention aims to strengthen the struggle against Violence against Women (VAW) in Turkey, influence public policies to strengthen and improve support mechanisms for women victims of VAW, as well as to raise public awareness on gender equality and VAW. The intervention&#x2019;s total budget is approximately SEK 22,4 Million, out of which 6,2 million SEK is contributed by other European donors including European Commission and the Embassy of the Netherlands.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Objectives:
Strategic Objective 1: Increase women&#x2019;s solidarity to strengthen the struggle against VAW in Turkey
Strategic Objective 2: Influence public policies to strengthen and improve support mechanisms to women for combatting with VAW
Strategic Objective 3: Raising public awareness on gender equality and VAW</narrative>
  </description>
